{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手任賢齊（小齊）昨日（24日）於澳門展開《齊跡》巡迴演唱會，在演唱會正式開鑼前，小齊率領團隊在後台舉行祈福拜神儀式，並與工作人員一同切乳豬，祈求演出順利、「由頭好到尾」。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;拜神儀式吸引了大批</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T01:21:49.409930+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T01:01:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T01:18:41.370819+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T01:18:41.370819+00:00","content_hash":"6edd8c18f3a65a9f67479a5d809b10194c427684f3e8eeaa22032e0c993bacb6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}